# Market Research
Market Research/
browser_use/
# .agents
.agents/

# Knowledge graph
# NOTE: the git repo root is one level ABOVE this project (C:\PROJECTS), and that
# root .gitignore excludes graphify-out/. So the rule "commit the new report"
# (P0-T2) could not be honoured until this was re-included.
#
# Re-include only the human-readable report. graph.json is ~900 KB and graph.html
# ~740 KB of generated output that would dominate the repo and churn on every
# commit. The report is what a person actually reads; the graph is a local
# artifact that graphify rebuilds on demand.
!graphify-out/
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
